Overview
This FAQ covers common billing questions to help you quickly understand charges, invoices, and payments.


How am I billed?
Billing is typically processed on a recurring basis (monthly or annually depending on your plan).


Where can I find my invoices?
Go to Billing Settings
Select Invoices
Download or view your invoice history

Why was I charged more than expected?
Common reasons include:

Plan upgrades
Additional users or services
Prorated charges
If something doesn’t look right, contact support with your invoice details.


What should I do if I was charged twice?
If you believe a duplicate charge occurred:

Check your invoice history
Note the invoice numbers and dates
Contact support with this information
We’ll review and resolve the issue promptly.


What payment methods are accepted?
Credit/Debit cards
(Optional: add others if needed for realism)

Can I change my billing plan?
Yes:

Go to Billing Settings
Select Change Plan
Choose your preferred option

How do I cancel my subscription?
Navigate to Billing Settings
Select Cancel Subscription
Follow the prompts

Who do I contact for billing support?
Reach out to support with:

Invoice number
Description of the issue
We’ll respond as quickly as possible.

